            "review_text": "Ashleyvietnam\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam159 contributions\n0\nSushi Heaven\nFeb 2016 • Family\nFirst of all, this is the only sushi buffet in Saigon allow you eat sashimi as much as you want.\n\nYou can see, I have been to many sushi restaurant so this place is one of my famous place for sushi.\n\nThe menu is variety. Buy a buffet than all you can eat. Even the sashimi.\n\nThe price is kinda high but I told you, the food is worth it.\n\nInstead of paying a lot of money just for a little sashimi. With the same price you can have all sashimi you want.\n\nThe food is fresh and the service is good to.\n\nBetter try it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 9, 2016",
