            "review_text": "Cuongfvn\nHo Chi Minh City, null, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nGood place for the price\nJan 2016 • Family\n3 of us came for buffet and picked highest price (about 430.000vnd per head)\nService staff was so helpful. They looked after us well\nWe order some green tea soda and passion fruit juice. Quality of drinks is normal\nSalad bar was limited and not good\nFood order follow the buffet (this restaurant serves buffet the way we order and they will serve course by course no limit) and food is just ok. Sashimi doesn't seems very fresh or well prepare which some sapa fish sashimi smell no good.\nGrilled items are good. Some US beef is tough but the rest are nice\nDrinks: ok\nSalad bar: need improve\nFood: ok\nService: excellent \n\nWill come back for a la carte\n\nPs: not like other Japanese restaurant, this place accept tip\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2016",
